# Docker-Only Development

There is no local tooling installed on the host machine. All commands (dev server, build, install, etc.) must be run inside the Docker container.

- Container name: `bjornarhagen-no`
- Run commands via: `docker exec bjornarhagen-no <command>`
- Docker Compose file: `.devcontainer/docker-compose.local.yml`
- Working directory in container: `/app`
- Runtime: Bun

```bash
# ✅ GOOD
docker exec bjornarhagen-no bun run dev
docker exec bjornarhagen-no bun install

# ❌ BAD: running directly on host (no local tooling)
bun run dev
bun install
```

- Dev server: port 3000 (`bun run dev`)
- Production build: `bun run build`
